{"seq":2,"slug":"experiment-design","title":"混沌实验场景设计方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/experiment-design","wordCount":801,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"混沌实验场景设计方法\">混沌实验场景设计方法</h1><p>知道了可以注入什么故障，下一步是决定<strong>应该优先注入什么故障</strong>。无目的地随机注入是危险且低效的；假说驱动的实验设计让每次实验都有清晰的目标和可验证的结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>假说驱动设计</td>\n<td>先提出可验证的假说，再设计实验验证或证伪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级矩阵</td>\n<td>按&quot;可能性 × 影响度&quot;对实验场景排优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场景库（Scenario Catalog）</td>\n<td>标准化的实验场景集合，可复用和版本化管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失效模式分析（FMEA）</td>\n<td>系统化识别每个组件可能的失效模式及其影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"假说驱动的实验设计\">假说驱动的实验设计</h2><p>每个混沌实验应从一个具体假说出发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"假说格式：&#10;&quot;当 [故障条件] 时，[系统行为] 将 [保持/不超过/恢复到] [稳态指标]&quot;&#10;&#10;示例：&#10;- &quot;当支付服务网络延迟增加 500ms 时，订单服务的 P99 延迟不超过 1s&quot;&#10;- &quot;当 Redis 缓存节点故障时，系统降级到数据库查询，错误率 &lt; 0.5%&quot;&#10;- &quot;当 30% 的 Kafka 消费者被重启时，消息 Lag 在 5 分钟内恢复到正常水平&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>假说格式：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"当 [故障条件] 时，[系统行为] 将 [保持/不超过/恢复到] [稳态指标]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>示例：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- \"当支付服务网络延迟增加 500ms 时，订单服务的 P99 延迟不超过 1s\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- \"当 Redis 缓存节点故障时，系统降级到数据库查询，错误率 &#x3C; 0.5%\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- \"当 30% 的 Kafka 消费者被重启时，消息 Lag 在 5 分钟内恢复到正常水平\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>假说的好坏标准</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>好的假说</th>\n<th>差的假说</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可测性</td>\n<td>有具体的度量指标</td>\n<td>&quot;系统保持稳定&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障明确</td>\n<td>指定故障类型和范围</td>\n<td>&quot;模拟故障&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间边界</td>\n<td>指定验证时间窗口</td>\n<td>不指定时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可证伪</td>\n<td>实验结果可能证伪假说</td>\n<td>永远为真的假说</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"优先级矩阵\">优先级矩阵</h2><p>有限的实验时间应优先验证高价值的场景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 优先级矩阵&#10;        H1[高概率 + 高影响\\n立即实验]&#10;        H2[低概率 + 高影响\\n需要验证]&#10;        H3[高概率 + 低影响\\n定期验证]&#10;        H4[低概率 + 低影响\\n最后考虑]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 优先级矩阵\n        H1[高概率 + 高影响\\n立即实验]\n        H2[低概率 + 高影响\\n需要验证]\n        H3[高概率 + 低影响\\n定期验证]\n        H4[低概率 + 低影响\\n最后考虑]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实验场景</th>\n<th>发生概率</th>\n<th>影响范围</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>支付服务数据库主库故障</td>\n<td>低（每年 1-2 次）</td>\n<td>高（支付中断）</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kubernetes 节点随机崩溃</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（部分服务中断）</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CDN 节点故障</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低（静态资源降速）</td>\n<td>P2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息队列延迟增加</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（异步处理延迟）</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"失效模式分析-fmea\">失效模式分析（FMEA）</h2><p>FMEA 是系统化识别实验场景的工具：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>失效模式</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>现有防御</th>\n<th>混沌实验设计</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>支付服务</td>\n<td>数据库连接超时</td>\n<td>网络抖动</td>\n<td>支付失败</td>\n<td>连接池重试</td>\n<td>注入 DB 网络延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存层</td>\n<td>Redis 主节点宕机</td>\n<td>硬件故障</td>\n<td>全量回源 DB</td>\n<td>哨兵自动切换</td>\n<td>Kill Redis 主节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息队列</td>\n<td>Broker 不可用</td>\n<td>进程崩溃</td>\n<td>消息积压</td>\n<td>消费者重试</td>\n<td>Kill Kafka Broker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载均衡</td>\n<td>上游节点全部不健康</td>\n<td>服务崩溃</td>\n<td>503 全量失败</td>\n<td>健康检查 + 熔断</td>\n<td>Kill 所有后端实例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实验模板\">实验模板</h2><p>标准化实验模板确保每次实验的完整性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"experiment:&#10;  id: chaos-2026-07-04-001&#10;  name: &#39;支付服务 DB 网络延迟实验&#39;&#10;&#10;  hypothesis:&#10;    condition: &#39;注入支付服务到数据库的 300ms 网络延迟&#39;&#10;    steady_state_metric: &#39;HTTP 支付成功率&#39;&#10;    expected_behavior: &#39;&gt;= 99.5%&#39;&#10;    observation_window: &#39;5分钟&#39;&#10;&#10;  blast_radius:&#10;    target: &#39;支付服务 Canary Pod（5%流量）&#39;&#10;    environment: &#39;生产环境&#39;&#10;    schedule: &#39;周二 14:00-14:30（有人值守）&#39;&#10;&#10;  abort_conditions:&#10;    - metric: &#39;支付成功率 &lt; 99%&#39;&#10;      action: &#39;立即回滚&#39;&#10;    - metric: &#39;P99 延迟 &gt; 2s&#39;&#10;      action: &#39;立即回滚&#39;&#10;&#10;  steps:&#10;    - &#39;建立5分钟稳态基线&#39;&#10;    - &#39;对 Canary Pod 注入 300ms DB 延迟&#39;&#10;    - &#39;观测 5 分钟，记录指标&#39;&#10;    - &#39;移除故障注入&#39;&#10;    - &#39;等待 2 分钟确认恢复&#39;&#10;&#10;  result:&#10;    hypothesis_validated: null&#10;    steady_state_deviation: null&#10;    findings: []&#10;    action_items: []\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">experiment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">chaos-2026-07-04-001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'支付服务 DB 网络延迟实验'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hypothesis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'注入支付服务到数据库的 300ms 网络延迟'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steady_state_metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HTTP 支付成功率'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    expected_behavior</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'>= 99.5%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    observation_window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5分钟'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  blast_radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'支付服务 Canary Pod（5%流量）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'生产环境'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    schedule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'周二 14:00-14:30（有人值守）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  abort_conditions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'支付成功率 &#x3C; 99%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'立即回滚'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'P99 延迟 > 2s'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'立即回滚'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'建立5分钟稳态基线'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'对 Canary Pod 注入 300ms DB 延迟'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'观测 5 分钟，记录指标'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'移除故障注入'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'等待 2 分钟确认恢复'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hypothesis_validated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steady_state_deviation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    findings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action_items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"场景库建设\">场景库建设</h2><p>将验证过的实验场景版本化管理，形成可复用的场景库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"chaos-scenarios/&#10;├── infrastructure/&#10;│   ├── node-failure.yaml&#10;│   ├── cpu-stress.yaml&#10;│   └── disk-pressure.yaml&#10;├── network/&#10;│   ├── latency-injection.yaml&#10;│   ├── packet-loss.yaml&#10;│   └── network-partition.yaml&#10;├── application/&#10;│   ├── pod-termination.yaml&#10;│   ├── memory-leak.yaml&#10;│   └── dependency-failure.yaml&#10;└── business/&#10;    ├── payment-service-degradation.yaml&#10;    └── search-service-failure.yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>chaos-scenarios/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── infrastructure/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── node-failure.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── cpu-stress.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── disk-pressure.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── network/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── latency-injection.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── packet-loss.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── network-partition.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── application/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── pod-termination.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── memory-leak.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── dependency-failure.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── business/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── payment-service-degradation.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── search-service-failure.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"关键实践清单\">关键实践清单</h2><ul>\n<li>每个实验场景对应一个待验证的假说，不做无假说的&quot;随机破坏&quot;</li>\n<li>用 FMEA 工作坊（2-4 小时）系统覆盖核心服务的失效模式</li>\n<li>优先从&quot;高影响 + 现有防御未经验证&quot;的场景开始</li>\n<li>场景库纳入版本控制，与代码仓库共同维护</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>假说驱动是混沌实验设计的核心原则，让每次实验都有清晰的价值目标。FMEA 工作坊帮助团队系统性发现实验场景，优先级矩阵指导资源分配。标准化模板和场景库让混沌工程成为可持续的工程实践，而非一次性活动。GameDay 组织方法见<a href=\"gameday-runbooks\">GameDay 演练组织</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"混沌实验场景设计方法","id":"混沌实验场景设计方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"假说驱动的实验设计","id":"假说驱动的实验设计"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级矩阵","id":"优先级矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"失效模式分析（FMEA）","id":"失效模式分析-fmea"},{"level":2,"text":"实验模板","id":"实验模板"},{"level":2,"text":"场景库建设","id":"场景库建设"},{"level":2,"text":"关键实践清单","id":"关键实践清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"故障注入类型分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/fault-injection-types"},"next":{"title":"GameDay 演练组织与故障响应剧本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/gameday-runbooks"}}